lovgon swvzwn eJautouð fusikwðû ajnalloivwton.</FOREIGN></P></DIV3> <DIV3 COM="0671" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0671"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Touð aujtouð, ejk touð aujtouð lovgou e'.</FOREIGN></HEAD> <P COM="0671"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Bhvrwn gavr tiû eænagcoû, meq1 eJtevrwn tinwðn, thún
