 <COL N="0671D"></COL> aujtwðn eijshgeiðtai proswpikhún× ajdiagnwstou
pantelwðû, thðé twðn ijdiomavtwn metabolhðé, thðû fusikhðû
aujtwðn genomevnhû uJpavrxewû.</FOREIGN></P></DIV3> <DIV3 COM="0671" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0671"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Touð aujtouð, ejk touð aujtouð lovgou z'.</FOREIGN></HEAD> <P COM="0671"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Eij deú thðû aujthðû auJtwðé, mhú gevgone fuvsewû, oujdeú thðû
