gegonwúû ijsovthtoû, kaiú tautovthtoû× oåper ajsebevû.</FOREIGN></P></DIV3> <DIV3 COM="0671" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0671"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Touð, aujtouð, ejk touð aujtouð lovgou hv'.</FOREIGN></HEAD> <COL N="0673A"></COL> <P COM="0673"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Eijû tauvthn deú thún plavnhn kathvcqhsan, kakwðû peisqevnteû
