calculo cognoscetur volentibus annis.</P> <CAPTION COM="1282"><HI REND="ITALIC">Incipit regula ad Kal. mensium inveniendas.</HI></CAPTION> <P COM="1282">Mart. V. Apr. I. Maius. III. Jun. VI. Jul. I. Augustus
IV. September. VII. October. II. Novemb. V.
