Kal. Apr. unus exprimitur I. Duodenae namque
docte quaternis IV. Septenae quinae sperant duo
II. Quartanae Kal. Quinae conjiciunt V.
Quindenae constant tribus adeptae III. End.</P> <CAPTION COM="1283"><HI REND="ITALIC">Incipit terminus ad Rog.</HI></CAPTION> <COL N="1283B"></COL> <P COM="1283">Luna XX. VI. Id. Mai. V. III. Kal. Mai. I.
